diff --git a/docs/api/sections/notifications.md b/docs/api/sections/notifications.md
index 6bddff1..69d108a 100644
--- a/docs/api/sections/notifications.md
+++ b/docs/api/sections/notifications.md
@@ -96,3 +96,23 @@ __Request:__
 __Response:__
 
 Returns `204 No Content` on success.
+
+## `POST /:account_slug/users/:user_id/push_subscriptions`
+
+Registers this browser to receive the current user’s notifications. Send the endpoint and base64url-encoded keys from the browser’s push subscription:
+
+```json
+{
+  "push_subscription": {
+    "endpoint": "https://fcm.googleapis.com/fcm/send/...",
+    "p256dh_key": "...",
+    "auth_key": "..."
+  }
+}
+```
+
+Returns `201 Created` with the subscription’s `id`. Registering the same endpoint again updates its keys.
+
+## `DELETE /:account_slug/users/:user_id/push_subscriptions/:id`
+
+Turns off notifications for this subscription only. Returns `204 No Content`.
